          <sense n="2">~ homicida <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 4a Cons, morðwyrhta <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ubersetzend"><abbr>übsnd</abbr></ref></hi> [<hi rend="italic">um in</hi> morð <hi rend="italic">die Verstecktheit, <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:imGegensatzZu"><abbr>im Ggs. zu</abbr></ref> offenem Totschlag, zu <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:bezeichnen"><abbr>bezeichnen</abbr></ref></hi>]</sense>
